This application provides users with a convenient and practical way to model binary or multi - classification tasks using the Logistic Regression algorithm. Logistic Regression is a classic linear model widely used in medical diagnosis, financial credit assessment, marketing prediction and other fields. It is characterized by high computational efficiency and strong interpretability of results. Users can import data, train models, adjust parameters, and perform prediction and visualization analysis. This guide will help you quickly master the application operation process.&#x20;

