This application provides a simple and intuitive way to use the CatBoost algorithm for Machine Learning modeling. CatBoost is an efficient layer boosting algorithm that specializes in handling categorical features and has the ability to automatically handle missing values and high-dimensional data. The algorithm is trained through a combined model based on decision trees and is suitable for classification, regression, and ranking tasks, and performs well on large-scale data sets. This application supports users to import data, train models, adjust parameters, and perform visual analysis of model performance.&#x20;

