#### Application Introduction&#x20;

The data preprocessing module aims to provide users with a one-stop data cleaning and standardization service, which is a prerequisite for any Machine Learning task. It helps users quickly identify and process defects and inconsistencies in the original data source, ensuring that the subsequent modeling process is more efficient and accurate.&#x20;

This module is especially suitable for the following scenarios:&#x20;

* There are a large number of missing values or outliers in the training data&#x20;

* Categorical variables need to be encoded and converted&#x20;

* Data of different dimensions need to be standardized&#x20;

* Want to build a standardized data processing process for deployment or reuse&#x20;

* Data of different dimensions need to be standardized&#x20;

