### Help Document&#x20;

#### 6. Application Introduction&#x20;

This application provides a powerful non-linear dimensionality reduction method, t-SNE, for dimensionality reduction and visualization of high-dimensional data. t-SNE is good at preserving the local structure and similarity of data in low-dimensional space (usually two or three dimensions), making it easier to intuitively discover clusters and patterns in complex data.&#x20;

&#x20;It is suitable for exploratory data analysis, pattern recognition and visualization before classification tasks. The application supports the import of various formats of data, preprocessing and graphical display of results to help users understand the internal structure of data.&#x20;

